Metal choice within the Falling Edge family is personal. White gold and platinum read cool and bright — correct for D–F color stones. Rose gold warms the ring and pairs particularly well with E–G color stones where a small amount of warmth in the step-cut table is a feature rather than a flaw.

Yellow gold is the warmest expression — pairs with G–H natural stones or any lab stone where color grade is less critical to appearance.

